{"id": "EUVD-2026-91849", "enisaUuid": "350cfce3-ddbe-3f90-900f-ac48503a6563", "description": "Mooncake transfer engine before 0.3.12 contains an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the readString function of include/common.h that allows unauthenticated attackers to crash the service by sending a zero-length handshake frame. Attackers can connect to the handshake port listening on all interfaces and send an eight-byte frame to terminate the hosting process, such as an SGLang inference server.", "datePublished": "2026-10-02T23:28:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T16:08:38", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/4452", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/commit/c142b40590259360196d8e504b2193382529e7b4", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mooncake-before-0.3.12-out-of-bounds-read-via-p2p-handshake-readstring"], "aliases": ["GHSA-ccgr-wx5m-4h7g", "CVE-2026-104433"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "38b83424-4fbb-338c-8a60-b88270c1b502", "product": {"name": "mooncake", "vendor": {"name": "kvcache-ai"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.3.12"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e354ce51-9b47-3427-8ada-8cb686002907", "vendor": {"name": "kvcache-ai"}}], "isExploited": false}